## Rules

Every task title must describe a concrete, actionable unit of work — never a vague
category like "Work on backend" or "Fix bug". A reviewer should be able to tell exactly
what "done" looks like from the title and description alone. Titles under three words are
rejected outright.

If the accepted analysis's work_family is DEVELOPMENT_WORK, at least one generated item
must be of type TEST, or at least one item must carry non-empty testing_requirements —
review and testing are never optional for development work.

Dependencies reference the temp_id of a sibling in this same decomposition and must form
an acyclic graph. Keep the total of estimated_hours reasonably close to the parent's
estimated_total_hours ({{ analysis.estimated_total_hours }}h) where that is known.

